      "content": "It’s just so much more dignified, isn't it? To finish while the work is still vital. If I stay, I'm just watching myself become a caricature of who I was. There's a kind of tragic beauty in knowing when the song has reached its natural end, rather than letting it drag on into silence and noise.",
